    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Titans of Commerce</strong>: A game where <strong>YOU!</strong> become the <strong>capitalist</strong> behind the shadows at the wake of <strong>WW1</strong>. Manipulate diplomacy, fund opposition's journals or even a coup! Triple your income via <strong>arms sales</strong>, profiting from global tension. <strong>Design, produce and sell</strong> the train, gun or ship of your will! <strong>Fund Governments</strong> and get hefty tax cuts. Improve your business day by day and <strong>open factories all around Europe.</strong> Thanks to the fund that were left to you with these tax cuts, improve your factories and even find talented people in their jobs and employ them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353510/extras/6ffa8068efd3f0a8ead45ae8376aaf07.avif?t=1753937411\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Topple Governments and Fund Politics </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meddle with politics, fund the party you like and help them get to power, in exchange; you can get several benefits and hefty tax cuts. You can maintain relations with +40 different authentic parties throughout the Europe, benefit and thrive your business with your political connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Locomotives, Guns, Ships; Sell Them to Governments in Need\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can design, produce and sell locomotives, ships and guns. You can utilize your political connections to bolster sense of threat between countries and incentivize governments to spend on your products!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Titans of Commerce</strong>: A game where <strong>YOU!</strong> become the <strong>capitalist</strong> behind the shadows at the wake of <strong>WW1</strong>. Manipulate diplomacy, fund opposition's journals or even a coup! Triple your income via <strong>arms sales</strong>, profiting from global tension. <strong>Design, produce and sell</strong> the train, gun or ship of your will! <strong>Fund Governments</strong> and get hefty tax cuts. Improve your business day by day and <strong>open factories all around Europe.</strong> Thanks to the fund that were left to you with these tax cuts, improve your factories and even find talented people in their jobs and employ them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353510/extras/6ffa8068efd3f0a8ead45ae8376aaf07.avif?t=1753937411\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Topple Governments and Fund Politics </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meddle with politics, fund the party you like and help them get to power, in exchange; you can get several benefits and hefty tax cuts. You can maintain relations with +40 different authentic parties throughout the Europe, benefit and thrive your business with your political connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Locomotives, Guns, Ships; Sell Them to Governments in Need\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can design, produce and sell locomotives, ships and guns. You can utilize your political connections to bolster sense of threat between countries and incentivize governments to spend on your products!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
